<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Barrett Resources raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Barrett Resources raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- A.G. Edwards has raised its rating for Barrett Resources Corp shares to buy from maintain, market sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Denver oil and natural gas exploration and production company were up 2-5/8 to 37-3/4 in mid-morning.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
